        },
        "text_hFzNwJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Looking for a way to create a more private outdoor space? MoonWall is a modular, packable privacy screen that can be attached to your existing MoonShade to provide continuous shade and increased privacy. The Long MoonWall attaches to the 9ft side or the 7 ft side of MoonShade and provides shade and privacy to any vehicle type. MoonWall is made of durable, lightweight materials and is available in Shadow Blue. The Long MoonWall measures 100\"x78\" and folds up to fit easily inside the MoonShade carry bag.<br/><br/>Find MoonWall Short <a href=\"/products/moonwall-short\" title=\"MoonWall Short\">here.</a></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
